@startuml F09-address-disclosure-sequence
title AddressStep — disclosure crédit : saisie → redeem → store → total

actor Yasmine
participant "AddressStep\n(<details>)" as Step
participant "InvitationCodeField" as Field
participant "MSW /api/coupons/redeem" as Redeem
participant "wizardStore" as Store
participant "WizardCartRecap\n(F10)" as Recap

note over Step
  init couponDisclosureOpen = !!couponCode
  store sans code → fermée ; avec code → ouverte d'office
end note

Yasmine -> Step : clic summary « J'ai un code de fidélité »
Step -> Step : onToggle → couponDisclosureOpen = true (chevron rotate-90)
Yasmine -> Field : saisit « FG-SAUGE-7212 », clic « Appliquer »
Field -> Redeem : POST { code }
Redeem --> Field : 200 { valid:true, valueCents:2000 }
Field -> Step : onValid('FG-SAUGE-7212', 2000)
Step -> Store : setCoupon('FG-SAUGE-7212', 2000)\n(upper/trim, clamp >=0)
Store --> Recap : credit = min(2000, total)\ntotal = total − credit (plancher 0)  [INV-422]

== Anti-stale ==
Yasmine -> Field : modifie un caractère
Field -> Step : onClear()
Step -> Store : clearCoupon() → couponCode=null, creditCents=0
@enduml
